An empty line

        head    tail
          |       |
          v       v
        null    null


After the first enqueue, both pointers hold the one node

        head    tail
          |       |
          v       v
       +-------------+
       |     Ida     |-----> null
       +-------------+


After the dequeue that hands Ida out, both are null again

        head    tail
          |       |
          v       v
        null    null
